{"seq":3,"slug":"cache-db-stock-consistency","title":"缓存与数据库库存最终一致","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/flash-sale-high-concurrency-gateway/cache-stock-deduct/cache-db-stock-consistency","wordCount":2337,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"缓存与数据库库存最终一致\">缓存与数据库库存最终一致</h1><p>把库存扣减放在 Redis 里，代价是系统里同时存在两个库存数字：Redis 中「已经扣掉多少」和数据库中「已经扣掉多少」。这两个数字在任何时刻都不相等——Redis 领先，数据库落后。这个差值不是 bug，而是设计的必然产物；但它必须是有界的、可解释的、可收敛的。一致性设计要回答的就是这四个问题：差值从哪里来、正常路径如何收敛、进程崩溃后如何恢复、什么情况下它会对不上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把-库存-拆成三个量\">核心概念：把「库存」拆成三个量</h2><p>讨论一致性之前，必须先明确到底在对什么求一致。库存这个词在秒杀链路里实际上指三个不同的量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>权威存储</th>\n<th>变化频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可售库存 <code>available</code></td>\n<td>还能卖多少</td>\n<td>Redis（秒杀期间）</td>\n<td>每次成功扣减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已售库存 <code>sold</code></td>\n<td>已成立订单占用多少</td>\n<td>数据库</td>\n<td>每次订单落库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冻结库存 <code>frozen</code></td>\n<td>已预扣但订单未成立</td>\n<td>Redis + 数据库</td>\n<td>预扣与确认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者的守恒关系是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">available + sold + frozen = flash\\_qty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">oz</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">flash\\_qty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 是预热快照写入的活动库存总量（见<a href=\"../cache-stock-deduct/hot-stock-cache-warmup\">热点库存缓存预热</a>）。这个等式是全 hub 所有对账逻辑的基准——任何时刻发现它不成立，都说明有一笔库存被凭空创造或凭空消失了。</p>\n<p>把「库存」拆成这三个量之后，「最终一致」的目标就变得精确了：<strong>不是让 Redis 和数据库的数字相等，而是让这个守恒等式在数据库侧最终成立</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差值的来源-三个不会自动消失的缝隙\">差值的来源：三个不会自动消失的缝隙</h2><h3 id=\"缝隙一-预扣成功但消息未投递\">缝隙一：预扣成功但消息未投递</h3><p>库存扣减在 Redis 成功后，需要投递一条消息到 MQ 才能触发订单落库（见<a href=\"../async-order-pipeline/mq-async-order-peakshed\">MQ 异步下单削峰填谷</a>）。如果 Redis 扣减成功、但在投递消息前进程崩溃，这笔扣减就永远不会有对应的订单——<code>available</code> 少了，<code>sold</code> 没变，库存凭空消失。</p>\n<p>这是最严重的缝隙，因为它导致的不是超卖而是<strong>少卖</strong>（库存被浪费）。它的修法是把「扣减」和「投递」放进同一份可恢复的记录里：扣减时同时在 Redis 写一条待投递记录，投递成功后删除。进程重启后扫描残留的待投递记录重新投递。</p>\n<h3 id=\"缝隙二-消息投递成功但消费未落库\">缝隙二：消息投递成功但消费未落库</h3><p>消息在队列里，消费者还没处理。这个缝隙是<strong>正常状态</strong>——异步化的本质就是让订单延迟落库。它不需要修复，只需要有界：只要消费者的处理速率大于生产速率，队列深度就不会无限增长；只要队列有监控，堆积就能被发现。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[Redis 扣减成功] --&gt; B[写待投递记录 pending_order_id]&#10;  B --&gt; C[投递 MQ]&#10;  C --&gt;|成功| D[删除待投递记录]&#10;  C --&gt;|失败/崩溃| E[残留待投递记录]&#10;  E --&gt; F[巡检任务扫描&lt;br/&gt;重新投递]&#10;  F --&gt; C&#10;  D --&gt; G[消费者落库]&#10;  G --&gt; H[订单成立&lt;br/&gt;sold += qty]\">graph TD\n  A[Redis 扣减成功] --&gt; B[写待投递记录 pending_order_id]\n  B --&gt; C[投递 MQ]\n  C --&gt;|成功| D[删除待投递记录]\n  C --&gt;|失败/崩溃| E[残留待投递记录]\n  E --&gt; F[巡检任务扫描&lt;br/&gt;重新投递]\n  F --&gt; C\n  D --&gt; G[消费者落库]\n  G --&gt; H[订单成立&lt;br/&gt;sold += qty]</pre><h3 id=\"缝隙三-落库成功但确认未回写\">缝隙三：落库成功但确认未回写</h3><p>订单落库后，需要把 Redis 里的「预扣」状态转成「确认」（<code>frozen -= qty</code>，或把预扣记录标记为已确认）。如果这一步失败，Redis 会认为这笔库存还处于预扣中，到了 TTL 会把它归还给 <code>available</code>——而订单其实已经成立，于是同一份库存被卖了两次。</p>\n<p>这个缝隙是<strong>超卖的直接来源</strong>，也是最危险的一个。它的防护是让「落库」和「确认」的相对顺序在失败时也保持安全：如果必须二选一，宁可「确认成功但落库失败」（导致少卖，可由对账修复）也不要「落库成功但确认失败」（导致超卖，不可逆）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收敛策略-三条路径\">收敛策略：三条路径</h2><p>差值必须有收敛的路径，否则它会随时间累积，最终使对账无法解释。</p>\n<h3 id=\"路径一-正常消费的自然收敛\">路径一：正常消费的自然收敛</h3><p>大多数缝隙会随正常流程自动闭合：消息被消费、订单落库、确认回写。这条路径覆盖 99% 以上的流量，不需要额外机制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"路径二-巡检任务的补偿收敛\">路径二：巡检任务的补偿收敛</h3><p>对异常残留，需要一个周期性巡检：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 待投递超时（缝隙一）：扣减了但没有订单&#10;SELECT p.order_id, p.sku_id, p.qty, p.created_at&#10;  FROM pending_deduct p&#10;  LEFT JOIN orders o ON o.order_id = p.order_id&#10; WHERE o.order_id IS NULL&#10;   AND p.created_at &lt; now() - interval &#39;30 seconds&#39;&#10; ORDER BY p.created_at&#10; LIMIT 500;&#10;&#10;-- 已落库但未确认（缝隙三）：订单成立了但库存没确认&#10;SELECT o.order_id, o.sku_id, o.qty, o.created_at&#10;  FROM orders o&#10;  LEFT JOIN stock_confirm c ON c.order_id = o.order_id&#10; WHERE c.order_id IS NULL&#10;   AND o.created_at &lt; now() - interval &#39;60 seconds&#39;&#10; ORDER BY o.created_at&#10; LIMIT 500;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 待投递超时（缝隙一）：扣减了但没有订单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pending_deduct p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 seconds'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 已落库但未确认（缝隙三）：订单成立了但库存没确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock_confirm c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'60 seconds'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个查询的超时阈值不同（30 秒对 60 秒），这是刻意的：缝隙一的修复方向是「重新投递」（安全，越早越好），缝隙三的修复方向是「补确认」（要谨慎，因为它可能在和一个正在执行中的事务竞争）。给缝隙三更长的等待窗口，可以过滤掉绝大多数「其实正在处理」的假阳性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"路径三-日终对账的强制收敛\">路径三：日终对账的强制收敛</h3><p>前两条路径都基于「Redis 里的状态是可信的」。如果 Redis 本身丢过数据（主从切换、实例被驱逐、有人误删 key），那么前两条路径都会失效。日终对账是唯一不依赖 Redis 的手段：它以数据库的 <code>sold</code> 为锚，反推 Redis 应该是什么状态，然后修正。</p>\n<p>对账的完整流程与补偿动作在<a href=\"../flash-safety-capacity/oversell-prevent-reconcile\">超卖防护与对账兜底</a>里展开，本节只强调它在一致性体系里的位置：<strong>它是兜底，不是常规路径</strong>。如果日终对账经常发现需要修正的差异，说明前两条路径有缺陷，应该去修路径而不是依赖对账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据模型的支撑\">数据模型的支撑</h2><p>三条收敛路径都要求系统能回答「这笔扣减/订单处于什么状态」。这需要一张跨越 Redis 与数据库的状态表。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE stock_flow (&#10;  flow_id      BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_id     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  activity_id  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  sku_id       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  shard        INT  NOT NULL,&#10;  qty          BIGINT NOT NULL CHECK (qty &gt; 0),&#10;  state        TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (state IN (&#10;                 &#39;DEDUCTED&#39;,   -- Redis 已扣，订单未落库&#10;                 &#39;ORDERED&#39;,    -- 订单已落库，Redis 未确认&#10;                 &#39;CONFIRMED&#39;,  -- 两端一致&#10;                 &#39;ROLLED_BACK&#39;,-- 已回滚归还&#10;                 &#39;RECONCILED&#39;  -- 对账修正&#10;               )),&#10;  deduct_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  order_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  confirm_at   TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  UNIQUE (order_id)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_flow_pending&#10;  ON stock_flow (deduct_at)&#10;  WHERE state IN (&#39;DEDUCTED&#39;, &#39;ORDERED&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> stock_flow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  flow_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IDENTITY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  activity_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shard        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                 'DEDUCTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Redis 已扣，订单未落库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                 'ORDERED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 订单已落库，Redis 未确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                 'CONFIRMED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 两端一致</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                 'ROLLED_BACK'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 已回滚归还</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                 'RECONCILED'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 对账修正</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">               )),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  deduct_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  confirm_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_flow_pending</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock_flow (deduct_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DEDUCTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ORDERED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>部分索引只覆盖两个中间态，因此索引体积与「正在流动中的订单数」成正比，而不是与历史总量成正比——这是处理高流量流水表的常用手法，与<a href=\"../cache-stock-deduct/hot-stock-cache-warmup\">热点库存缓存预热</a>的快照表、<a href=\"../flash-safety-capacity/oversell-prevent-reconcile\">超卖防护与对账兜底</a>的对账表共享同一种设计取向。</p>\n<p><code>UNIQUE (order_id)</code> 是这套模型的核心约束：它保证一笔订单在流水表里只有一行，因此所有状态的推进都是<strong>对同一行的更新</strong>，而不是插入新行。这让「查询某订单处于哪个缝隙」变成一次主键查找，也让巡检任务能安全地并发执行（多个巡检实例同时处理同一行时，<code>UPDATE ... WHERE state = &#39;DEDUCTED&#39;</code> 的条件更新会保证只有一个成功）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"状态推进用条件更新而非读改写\">状态推进用条件更新而非读改写</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 落库后推进到 ORDERED，仅当仍在 DEDUCTED&#10;UPDATE stock_flow&#10;   SET state = &#39;ORDERED&#39;, order_at = now()&#10; WHERE order_id = :order_id AND state = &#39;DEDUCTED&#39;&#10;RETURNING flow_id;&#10;&#10;-- 确认后推进到 CONFIRMED，仅当仍在 ORDERED&#10;UPDATE stock_flow&#10;   SET state = &#39;CONFIRMED&#39;, confirm_at = now()&#10; WHERE order_id = :order_id AND state = &#39;ORDERED&#39;&#10;RETURNING flow_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 落库后推进到 ORDERED，仅当仍在 DEDUCTED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock_flow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ORDERED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DEDUCTED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING flow_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 确认后推进到 CONFIRMED，仅当仍在 ORDERED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock_flow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CONFIRMED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, confirm_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ORDERED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING flow_id;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>条件更新（<code>WHERE state = ...</code>）是状态机的标准实现方式，它把「检查状态」和「改状态」合并成一次原子操作。如果 <code>RETURNING</code> 没有返回行，说明状态已经被别人推进过——这正是幂等的判据：重复的消息消费、重复的巡检都会命中这种情况，然后安静地跳过。这与<a href=\"../cache-stock-deduct/redis-lua-atomic-deduct\">Redis 原子预扣与 Lua 脚本</a>里「把检查与动作合并成一次原子操作」是同一条原则，只是执行位置从 Redis 换到了数据库。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性的取舍-为什么不做强一致\">一致性的取舍：为什么不做强一致</h2><p>一个自然的问题是：既然有这么多缝隙，为什么不在扣减时同步把数据库也更新了，做成强一致？</p>\n<p>答案是<strong>强一致会毁掉整个方案的价值</strong>。如果每次 Redis 扣减都要同步等一次数据库写入，那么数据库就回到了扣减的关键路径上，第二章开头要解决的问题原封不动地回来了——每秒几万次行锁竞争，连接池耗尽。Redis 的价值恰恰来自「把数据库移出关键路径」，而这个移动必然以「短暂的、有界的、可收敛的不一致」为代价。</p>\n<p>因此这里的正确框架不是「要不要一致」，而是<strong>不一致的窗口有多大、窗口内的失败模式是什么、窗口外如何收敛</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>窗口应该尽量短（消费延迟秒级而非分钟级）；</li>\n<li>窗口内的失败必须偏向「少卖」而不是「超卖」（因为少卖可修复，超卖不可逆）；</li>\n<li>窗口外必须有确定性的收敛路径，且收敛本身不能引入新的不一致（因此回滚要幂等、要有上界检查）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套取舍在<a href=\"../flash-safety-capacity/oversell-prevent-reconcile\">超卖防护与对账兜底</a>里会被推到极致：那里的假设是「所有主动性防护全部失效」，只剩下对账这一层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>库存应被拆成 <code>available</code>、<code>sold</code>、<code>frozen</code> 三个量，一致性目标是让守恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">available + sold + frozen = flash\\_qty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">oz</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 在数据库侧最终成立，而不是让两边的数字相等。</li>\n<li>差值有三个来源：扣减成功但消息未投递（少卖）、消息在途未消费（正常状态）、落库成功但确认未回写（超卖，最危险）。</li>\n<li>收敛有三条路径：正常消费的自然收敛、巡检任务的补偿收敛、以及不依赖 Redis 的日终对账强制收敛。</li>\n<li><code>stock_flow</code> 流水表用 <code>UNIQUE (order_id)</code> 保证一单一行的状态推进，用条件更新实现幂等，用部分索引控制索引体积。</li>\n<li>强一致不可取——它会把数据库重新放回关键路径。正确目标是让不一致窗口短、窗口内偏向少卖、窗口外收敛确定。</li>\n<li>参考：PostgreSQL 官方文档关于部分索引与 <code>UPDATE ... RETURNING</code> 的语义（postgresql.org/docs/current/indexes-partial.html、postgresql.org/docs/current/dml-returning.html）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>库存已经在内存里被安全扣减、并且有了可收敛的一致性账本。接下来要处理的是把扣减结果变成订单——同步做会拖垮链路，因此需要异步化，见<a href=\"../async-order-pipeline/mq-async-order-peakshed\">MQ 异步下单削峰填谷</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"缓存与数据库库存最终一致","id":"缓存与数据库库存最终一致"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把「库存」拆成三个量","id":"核心概念-把-库存-拆成三个量"},{"level":2,"text":"差值的来源：三个不会自动消失的缝隙","id":"差值的来源-三个不会自动消失的缝隙"},{"level":3,"text":"缝隙一：预扣成功但消息未投递","id":"缝隙一-预扣成功但消息未投递"},{"level":3,"text":"缝隙二：消息投递成功但消费未落库","id":"缝隙二-消息投递成功但消费未落库"},{"level":3,"text":"缝隙三：落库成功但确认未回写","id":"缝隙三-落库成功但确认未回写"},{"level":2,"text":"收敛策略：三条路径","id":"收敛策略-三条路径"},{"level":3,"text":"路径一：正常消费的自然收敛","id":"路径一-正常消费的自然收敛"},{"level":3,"text":"路径二：巡检任务的补偿收敛","id":"路径二-巡检任务的补偿收敛"},{"level":3,"text":"路径三：日终对账的强制收敛","id":"路径三-日终对账的强制收敛"},{"level":2,"text":"数据模型的支撑","id":"数据模型的支撑"},{"level":3,"text":"状态推进用条件更新而非读改写","id":"状态推进用条件更新而非读改写"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性的取舍：为什么不做强一致","id":"一致性的取舍-为什么不做强一致"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Redis 原子预扣与 Lua 脚本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/flash-sale-high-concurrency-gateway/cache-stock-deduct/redis-lua-atomic-deduct"},"next":{"title":"MQ 异步下单削峰填谷","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/flash-sale-high-concurrency-gateway/async-order-pipeline/mq-async-order-peakshed"}}